      en: ["The mountains reach peak elevations exceeding 2,500 meters.", "They consist predominantly of ancient Precambrian metamorphic rocks.", "The Habab tribe is a major subgroup of the Tigre ethnic group.", "The region is historically known for the collection of myrrh and frankincense.", "The rugged terrain served as a strategic hideout during the independence war.", "Juniper forests are found in the mist-shrouded higher elevations."],
